{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","噜噜冲锋"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Lumont's Charge"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对一条直线上的敌人发起冲锋造成伤害并击退至终点。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont charges toward enemies in a line, dealing damage and knocking them back toward the selected tile."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择范围内一条直线方向上的一个地图格发起冲锋，将沿途目标击退至终点附近。冲锋结束后对邻格范围内的敌人造成240% + 30% ATK伤害，并嘲讽其3秒。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont selects a tile in range and charges at it, knocking enemies in his path back toward the selected tile. When Lumont reaches the selected tile, he deals 240% + 30% ATK damage to all adjacent enemies and taunts them for 3s. Lumont is unaffected while casting the skill."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":162,"end":168,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":70,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":82,"end":84,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":158,"end":172,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":208,"end":214,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":238,"end":248,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","嘲讽时长提升至4秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Taunts enemies for 4s."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":0,"end":2,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":0,"end":6,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 280% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 300% + 30% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":24,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","图腾护佑"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Totem Ward"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自身添加护盾，附近敌人数量越多护盾值越高。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont gains a shield. The more enemies nearby, the higher shield value."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","图腾柱的力量为自身添加抵御450% + 40% ATK伤害的护盾持续12秒，并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升30%。同时为身边最近的2名友军提升30%的护甲，持续7秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont gains a shield from the Totem Ward that blocks 450% + 40% ATK damage for 12s. For every adjacent enemy, the shield value is increased by 30%. He also increases Phys DEF of 2 closest allies by 30% for 7s."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":23,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升35%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value by 35% for every adjacent enemy."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升40%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value by 40% for every adjacent enemy."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","并且自身邻格范围内每存在一名敌人，护盾的抵御值额外提升45%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the shield value by 45% for every adjacent enemy."],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","战争践踏"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/en","War Stomp"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","踩踏地面造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont stomps the ground to deal AoE damage."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","噜噜踩踏地面，对附近1格范围内的敌人造成240% ATK伤害和1 + 0.25秒眩晕。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont stomps the ground, dealing 240% ATK damage to adjacent enemies and stunning them for 1 + 0.25s."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":93,"end":100,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":34,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 260% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每命中一名敌人，减少本技能1秒剩余冷却时间。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Reduces this skill's cooldown by 1s for every enemy hit."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 280% ATK."],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/en","Hero Focus"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，当相邻敌人较多时进一步提升急速。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont increases his Haste during battle, and it further increases when there are multiple enemies nearby."],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高9点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升6点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont increases his Haste by 9 during battle. His Haste is increased by an extra 6 when there are at least 2 enemies nearby."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升8点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Lumont increases his Haste by 12 during battle. His Haste is increased by an extra 8 when there are at least 2 enemies nearby."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速，且当相邻敌人不少于2人时，额外提升10点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Lumont increases his Haste by 15 during battle. His Haste is increased by an extra 10 when there are at least 2 enemies nearby."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","撼地怒击"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Totem Slam"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","每累计受到一定伤害会发起一次暴怒攻击对不同范围内的敌人造成伤害并降低攻击力。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont slams the ground after receiving a certain amount of damage, dealing damage to enemies within various ranges and reducing their ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每累计受到40%最大生命值的伤害时，使用图腾连续砸地3次，依次对自身周围1格、2格、3格范围内的敌人造成150% ATK伤害，并降低其25%攻击力持续6秒，最后一击还会将敌人击飞。施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont slams the ground with totem 3 times after receiving damage equal to 40% of his max HP, dealing 150% ATK damage to enemies within 1, 2, and 3 tiles in order and reducing their ATK by 25% for 6s. His 3rd slam also knocks the enemies hit into the air. Lumont is unaffected while casting the skill."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":98,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":102,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":266,"end":276,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始以及首个友军被击败时，可额外使用一次该技能。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Gains an extra skill attempt when a battle starts or an ally is defeated for the first time."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 180% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至210% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 210% ATK."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“图腾护佑”中的护盾存在时，每秒回复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Lumont recovers HP per second while shielded by Totem Ward."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“图腾护佑”中的护盾存在时，自身每秒回复7% HP的生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Lumont recovers 7% HP HP per second while shielded by Totem Ward."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":16,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","首次释放“撼地怒击”时，自身获得500% ATK“图腾护佑”的护盾，并使“战争践踏”获得永久强化，造成的眩晕时间增加1秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","The first time Lumont casts Totem Slam, he gains a Totem Ward shield equal to 500% ATK and permanently enhances War Stomp, increasing its stun duration by 1s."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":78,"end":86,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","大地之怒"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Earth's Wrath"]]}